@layout "layout.nview"

@section "content"

<div class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">{{ subjudul }}</p>
    <span class="version-pill">Rikat Declarative / PrimeNG-Style</span>
</div>

<div class="prose">
    <p>Penunjuk tahapan wizard deklaratif ala <code>&lt;p-steps&gt;</code> di PrimeNG dengan status otomatis <code>completed</code>, <code>active</code>, dan <code>pending</code>.</p>

    <div class="component-card">
    <div class="component-header">
        <span class="component-title">Stepper Multi-Langkah Deklaratif</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-copy-code"><l-icon name="copy" size="13"></l-icon> <span>Salin</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="component-canvas component-canvas-stacked">
        <div style="width: 100%;">
    <l-stepper>
        <l-step label="Pendaftaran Akun" status="completed"></l-step>
        <l-step label="Profil Bisnis" status="active"></l-step>
        <l-step label="Verifikasi Data" status="pending"></l-step>
        <l-step label="Selesai" status="pending"></l-step>
    </l-stepper>
</div>
    </div>
    <pre class="component-code-block"><code>&lt;!-- Declarative Stepper Wizard --&gt;
&lt;l-stepper&gt;
    &lt;l-step label="Pendaftaran Akun" status="completed"&gt;&lt;/l-step&gt;
    &lt;l-step label="Profil Bisnis" status="active"&gt;&lt;/l-step&gt;
    &lt;l-step label="Verifikasi Data" status="pending"&gt;&lt;/l-step&gt;
    &lt;l-step label="Selesai" status="pending"&gt;&lt;/l-step&gt;
&lt;/l-stepper&gt;</code></pre>
</div>

    <div class="bottom-nav">
        <a href="/komponen/navigasi" class="btn-page-nav btn-page-nav-prev"><l-icon name="arrow-left" size="15"></l-icon><span>Sebelumnya: Tab & Segmen</span></a>
        <a href="/komponen/timeline" class="btn-page-nav btn-page-nav-next"><span>Selanjutnya: Timeline Aktivitas</span><l-icon name="arrow-right" size="15"></l-icon></a>
    </div>
</div>

@rampung
